			<item>
				<title>🏗️ Building a Secure &amp; Automated Portfolio</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/blog/building-portfolio/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 01 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/blog/building-portfolio/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-tech-stack&#34;&gt;The Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To host my professional certifications and projects, I chose &lt;strong&gt;Hugo&lt;/strong&gt;, a static site generator known for speed and security. By using a static framework, I&amp;rsquo;ve minimized the attack surface of my portfolio while ensuring lightning-fast load times.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;key-features-implemented&#34;&gt;Key Features Implemented:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automated Certification Gallery&lt;/strong&gt;: I developed a custom Hugo shortcode to dynamically pull 24+ LinkedIn Learning PDFs from my storage directory, automatically formatting the titles for a clean user experience.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/strong&gt;: The site is version-controlled via &lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt; and deployed using &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrating a foundational understanding of CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Decoupling&lt;/strong&gt;: I customized the Aafu theme by overriding internal templates in the root directory, ensuring my content remains portable and secure during theme updates.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-this-matters&#34;&gt;Why This Matters&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In Cybersecurity, documentation and clear communication are just as vital as technical skill. This site serves as a living document of my journey at Full Sail University and my commitment to continuous professional development.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Cybersecurity Resources</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/links/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/links/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;hello-world&#34;&gt;HELLO WORLD&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-daily-drivers--learning&#34;&gt;🛡️ Daily Drivers &amp;amp; Learning&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://tryhackme.com&#34;&gt;TryHackMe&lt;/a&gt; - Gamified cybersecurity training.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.hackthebox.com&#34;&gt;Hack The Box&lt;/a&gt; - Advanced penetration testing labs.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://overthewire.org/wargames/&#34;&gt;OverTheWire&lt;/a&gt; - Great for learning Linux commands via wargames.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-technical-tools&#34;&gt;🔧 Technical Tools&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef/&#34;&gt;CyberChef&lt;/a&gt; - The &amp;ldquo;Cyber Swiss Army Knife&amp;rdquo; for encoding/decoding.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shodan.io&#34;&gt;Shodan&lt;/a&gt; - Search engine for Internet-connected devices.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gtfobins.github.io&#34;&gt;GTFOBins&lt;/a&gt; - Curated list of Unix binaries that can be used to bypass local security.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-documentation--roadmaps&#34;&gt;📚 Documentation &amp;amp; Roadmaps&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/&#34;&gt;OWASP Top 10&lt;/a&gt; - The standard awareness document for web app security.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nist.gov/cyberframework&#34;&gt;NIST Cybersecurity Framework&lt;/a&gt; - Industry standards for security.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;--job-boards--&#34;&gt;&amp;mdash;&amp;ndash;  Job Boards  &amp;mdash;&amp;ndash;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/&#34;&gt;LinkedIn Jobs&lt;/a&gt; - Easy way to search for professional jobs and apply right on LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.indeed.com/q-Cyber-Security-jobs.html?vjk=90c4fd65e94e6d07&#34;&gt;Indeed - Cybersecurity Roles&lt;/a&gt; - Preset link to Cybersecurity jobs on Indeed.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.clearancejobs.com/&#34;&gt;ClearanceJobs&lt;/a&gt; - A place for Veterans like me to look for gainful employment.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
